/*--------------------------------*- Choupo -*-----------------------*\
  Membrane (CASE-LOCAL): Toray TM820E seawater membrane, water permeance
  ONLY -- the transport record behind TM820E-400.dat.

  A_w is NOT stated by the case study: it is DERIVED here, once, so that the
  element delivers the document's 28.3 m3/d at the assumed standard test of
  TM820E-400.dat (32,000 ppm NaCl, 5.52 MPa, 25 C, 8 % recovery) -- found by
  running the module at that test (the engine prints its permeate beside the
  sheet's at every run, `[ratedTest]`) and moving A_w until the two agree.
  It is a calibration to the manufacturer's claim, origin `assumed`; the
  rejections are NOT here (the law that runs the case takes them from the
  rated tests), and no solute permeability B_s is declared.
\*---------------------------------------------------------------------------*/

name           TM820E;
kind           RO;
manufacturer   "Toray";

A_w            3.875e-7  m/s/bar;     // DERIVED, see header
